			"Message": "style(Output): Normalize indentation in shell script case statements\n\nAlign the body blocks of `case` statements in `Run.sh` and `prepublishOnly.sh` to a consistent indentation level. The previous formatting mixed hard tabs and spaces within the branch bodies, violating the project's whitespace conventions.\n\nThis change applies a uniform 0-tab indent level for case labels and 1-tab indent for branch bodies and associated comments across both scripts. No functional behavior is altered; the update strictly improves code consistency and readability.",
